    "utc_instant": {
      "description": "An EXACT UTC instant, or a pre-population literal. RFC3339 with a literal Z, never a local Windows time zone and never an offset form. DAG node N09 requires \"one exact UTC instant, expressed in UTC and not in a local Windows time zone\"; this definition is that requirement made mechanically enforceable. The two pre-population literals are preserved so an unfilled hole stays a hole rather than becoming a schema violation.",
